<BaseLayout title="Account deletion" description="Request deletion of your Pashu Saathi account and learn about retained transaction records."><div class="container"><header class="page-heading"><h1>Request account deletion</h1><p>A deletion request must be submitted to the shop. Viewing this page does not delete an account.</p></header><article class="prose section"><h2>From your account</h2><ol><li>Connect to the internet and sign in with the Google account used for your orders.</li><li>Open Account and choose the account-deletion request action.</li><li>Submit your request and check the visible processing status. The request is not complete until the server confirms it.</li></ol><a class="button" href="/app/#account">Open account settings</a><h2>Cannot sign in?</h2><p>Use the shop contact information to ask for account-deletion assistance. The shop must verify your identity before sharing or changing records. Never send passwords, sign-in codes or payment screenshots to the developer portfolio email.</p><a href="/contact/">Shop contact details</a><h2>What may be retained</h2><p>The shop reviews personal profile data for deletion and explains any necessary retention of bills, receipts and transaction records. Financial audit records cannot simply be erased. A pending request is not a promise that all information has already been removed.</p><p>In an unconfigured preview, account requests cannot be submitted. Shop contact and retention details must be supplied before production release.</p></article></div></BaseLayout>
